<title>JAPAN: Shigi Shipbuilding - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shigi Shipbuilding - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		693    million	  vs	  862    million</p>
<p> Operating    loss 40    million	  vs    loss 23    million</p>
<p> Current	loss 39    million	  vs    loss 25    million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 40    million	  vs    loss 26    million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 20.11 yen	  vs    loss 13.07 yen</p>
<p> Shares		2 million	  vs	   2 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  0.00 yen	  vs	    0.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shigi Shipbuilding Co Ltd is a large maker of lifeboats for ships.</p>
